WEBVTT

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:19.680
Shriv: Highness.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.140
Leia: Danger Leader. Four of us will have to do.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.680
Leia: Anyone know your way around machines?

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:26.400
Del: I do.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:27.240
Leia: You’re with me.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:28.260
Shriv: Uhh-

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:43.400
Leia: Theed has a defense system, something we can use to stop the Empire, but this storm has damaged power relays across the city. Until they're repaired, we can't activate anything. Split up. Repair the relays. When you’re done, regroup at the Palace.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:44.280
Iden: Got it.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.420
Shriv: Yeah. Got it.
